'''Ender Nodes''', also known as '''Shiny Blocks''' or '''Glowing Blocks''', are blocks found in {{zone|The End}}. They have the appearance of {{Item|Purple Hardened Clay}} and emit purple particles. Upon breaking, loot will drop.

== Mechanics ==
An '''Ender Node''' is a {{Item|Purple Hardened Clay}} block that replaces {{Item|End Stone}} or {{Item|Obsidian}}. Mining an '''Ender Node''' will cause it to drop items or spawn {{MobSprite|Nest Endermite;Nest Endermites}}. Afterwards, it first turns into {{Item|Bedrock}} then and 5 seconds after into {{Item|End Stone}} or {{Item|Obsidian}}.

Initially, {{Item|End Stone|amount=18}} and {{Item|Obsidian|amount=18}} blocks are replaced with their respective '''Ender Nodes''' around the island. Every {{Green|0.25}} seconds, if there's less than {{Green|18}} '''Ender Nodes''' of a respective type, another one spawns at a random spot.<ref>
