</ref>

=== Drops ===
While the block is replaced with the {{Item|Purple Hardened Clay}}, initial one ({{Item|End Stone}} or {{Item|Obsidian}}) is still used to determine the drop. {{Item|Stonk}} nullifies the {{MobSprite|Nest Endermite}}s outcome.

