== Trivia ==
*<!--*There are Sponge and Wet Sponge '''Ender Nodes''', but they can't be mined.<ref name=":0">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R8JCRvZPMPc</ref>-->Breaking an '''Ender Node''' for the first time will reward the player with the {{ach|Oh Shiny|ach=true}}.
*'''Ender Nodes''' have been referred to as different things over time:
**In 0.7.11 changelog, they were referred to as nodes.<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/skyblock-patch-0-7-11-reforges.3064970/</ref>
**They were called "Glowing Block" in the {{ach|Oh Shiny|ach=true}}'s description "Mine a Glowing Block on the End Island".
**Multiple players refered to them as "Shiny Blocks".
**Finally, they were named Ender Nodes since [[Changelog/2022/October 13/AHN|October 13, 2022]] on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]].

